WEBVTT

01:35.789 --> 01:40.690
[Fated Hearts]

01:41.600 --> 01:44.020
[Episode 22]

02:03.920 --> 02:05.380
Greetings, Your Majesty.

02:06.230 --> 02:07.230
The two princes have been

02:07.230 --> 02:08.560
accompanying His Majesty this whole time.

02:08.560 --> 02:10.280
I advised them to go back and rest.

02:10.280 --> 02:11.009
Tonight,

02:11.039 --> 02:13.370
I will stay here
to watch over His Majesty.

02:14.960 --> 02:15.780
Leave us.

02:17.520 --> 02:19.980
I already know about
His Majesty's illness.

02:21.030 --> 02:23.490
Please take care of yourself,
Your Majesty.

02:24.050 --> 02:25.980
Let me have a moment alone with him.

02:26.470 --> 02:27.050
Your Majesty...

02:27.050 --> 02:27.670
Get out!

02:51.960 --> 02:53.130
Fifteen years.

02:55.030 --> 02:57.030
You've been terminally ill for 15 years,

02:57.030 --> 02:57.840
and you never

02:57.840 --> 02:59.240
said a word to me about it.

03:00.710 --> 03:01.510
Your Majesty,

03:03.550 --> 03:05.880
you've really been keeping me in the dark.

03:10.710 --> 03:11.370
Never mind.

03:13.120 --> 03:14.580
You must have your reasons

03:15.030 --> 03:16.310
for not telling me.

03:19.590 --> 03:20.400
You're always the one

03:20.400 --> 03:21.800
who makes the most sense.

03:23.560 --> 03:25.620
We've been married for so many years.

03:25.710 --> 03:26.710
When have you ever considered me

03:26.710 --> 03:28.110
in any of your decisions?

03:32.750 --> 03:33.550
Your Majesty,

03:34.480 --> 03:35.280
guess

03:35.310 --> 03:36.590
what I've brought you.

03:39.870 --> 03:40.560
Zongzi.

03:41.840 --> 03:43.640
You didn't expect that, did you?

03:43.750 --> 03:45.230
Those people must think

03:45.250 --> 03:46.970
I've lost my mind.

03:47.630 --> 03:49.840
The Dragon Boat Festival was a month ago,

03:49.840 --> 03:52.370
but today I suddenly feel like
having zongzi.

03:53.630 --> 03:55.300
Your Majesty, you know

03:57.760 --> 03:59.710
I've always loved zongzi.

04:01.430 --> 04:02.150
But...

04:03.190 --> 04:04.100
I haven't had one

04:04.100 --> 04:05.300
in 15 years.

04:19.269 --> 04:20.070
Your Majesty,

04:21.200 --> 04:22.660
zongzi is so delicious.

04:24.160 --> 04:24.870
Smell it.

04:25.800 --> 04:27.060
Doesn't it smell good?

04:28.170 --> 04:29.320
Do you know

04:30.830 --> 04:31.870
why I haven't eaten zongzi

04:31.870 --> 04:32.920
in 15 years?

04:34.360 --> 04:35.750
Of course you do.

04:37.870 --> 04:40.200
On the 5th day of the 5th month
15 years ago,

04:40.870 --> 04:42.930
that woman died right in front of you.

04:43.600 --> 04:44.630
Since then,

04:45.360 --> 04:47.800
you've never celebrated
the Dragon Boat Festival again,

04:47.800 --> 04:49.530
and you've never eaten zongzi.

04:49.870 --> 04:50.670
Your Majesty.

04:52.950 --> 04:54.330
You actually have the leisure today

04:54.330 --> 04:55.960
to tend to plants?

04:57.310 --> 04:58.190
These plants

04:58.190 --> 05:00.190
must have accumulated great fortune

05:00.190 --> 05:02.590
over several lifetimes to receive your...

05:05.800 --> 05:08.030
What brings you here today?

05:09.550 --> 05:11.160
I came to celebrate the festival with you.

05:11.160 --> 05:11.980
Today is the Dragon Boat Festival.

05:11.980 --> 05:15.040
Your Majesty,
you haven't had any zongzi yet, have you?

05:16.600 --> 05:18.430
I made these myself today.

05:19.900 --> 05:21.630
They're just freshly steamed.

05:21.830 --> 05:23.560
Please try some, Your Majesty.

05:24.910 --> 05:25.970
I have no appetite.

05:26.510 --> 05:28.110
Just one bite, Your Majesty.

05:28.360 --> 05:29.190
Your Majesty.

05:29.260 --> 05:30.190
How dare you!

05:39.270 --> 05:40.070
Your Majesty.

05:44.270 --> 05:44.800
Get up.

05:47.950 --> 05:48.950
I don't want them.

05:50.070 --> 05:50.870
Take them away

05:51.360 --> 05:52.960
and share them with the kids.

06:02.920 --> 06:04.360
You said you hated her

06:05.310 --> 06:07.630
and forbade anyone
from ever mentioning her.

06:07.630 --> 06:08.830
You erased

06:08.830 --> 06:09.890
every trace of her,

06:10.680 --> 06:11.800
as if

06:11.800 --> 06:13.390
she had never existed.

06:16.590 --> 06:17.700
But she's here.

06:18.920 --> 06:20.380
She's been here all along.

06:21.950 --> 06:23.630
I've spent 15 years

06:24.690 --> 06:26.560
and still haven't been able
to reach your heart.

06:26.560 --> 06:27.310
Is it because

06:28.480 --> 06:29.510
you don't care about me

06:29.510 --> 06:30.570
that you've hidden

06:30.920 --> 06:32.650
your terminal illness from me?

06:34.750 --> 06:35.480
Fine.

06:39.750 --> 06:41.190
From today on,

06:41.870 --> 06:44.159
I don't care whether you like me or not.

06:46.430 --> 06:48.280
I only want what I like.

07:17.720 --> 07:18.750
I've already given you

07:18.750 --> 07:20.150
the first half of my life.

07:20.870 --> 07:23.270
Now I want you to spend the rest of it
with me!

07:23.340 --> 07:24.270
Feng Pingcheng!

07:24.270 --> 07:25.340
Wake up!

07:25.430 --> 07:26.360
Feng Pingcheng!

07:27.680 --> 07:28.560
Wake up!

07:30.000 --> 07:30.930
Feng Pingcheng!

07:31.510 --> 07:32.620
Wake up!

07:32.920 --> 07:33.680
Feng Pingcheng!

07:33.680 --> 07:34.270
Pull the Empress away!

07:34.270 --> 07:35.680
Open your eyes and look at me!

07:35.680 --> 07:36.080
Hurry!

07:36.120 --> 07:37.050
Feng Pingcheng!

07:37.560 --> 07:38.720
Let go of me!

07:39.190 --> 07:40.390
Feng Pingcheng!

07:41.270 --> 07:42.280
Wake up!

07:42.360 --> 07:45.240
Feng Pingcheng, wake up right now!

07:46.040 --> 07:46.970
Feng Pingcheng!

07:54.390 --> 07:55.190
Your Majesty.

07:56.920 --> 07:57.920
Your Majesty...

07:58.480 --> 07:59.950
What should I do?

08:01.480 --> 08:02.830
What should I do now?

08:04.920 --> 08:05.850
Your Majesty...

08:06.000 --> 08:07.120
Feng Pingcheng!

08:08.540 --> 08:09.390
Let go of me!

08:09.480 --> 08:10.360
Let go of me!

08:11.360 --> 08:12.630
I can walk by myself!

08:41.659 --> 08:43.260
[Yifeng Palace]

08:47.910 --> 08:48.750
Get lost! All of you!

08:48.750 --> 08:49.550
-Yes.
-Yes.

08:53.670 --> 08:54.790
All of you, get out!

09:13.870 --> 09:14.750
Mother.

09:20.360 --> 09:20.910
Mother.

09:21.550 --> 09:22.480
Don't be too sad.

09:23.150 --> 09:24.150
I'm here with you.

09:25.080 --> 09:25.880
Brother said

09:26.080 --> 09:27.880
that Father will surely wake up.

09:28.480 --> 09:29.120
Mother,

09:29.600 --> 09:31.260
please take care of yourself.

09:31.360 --> 09:32.960
Don't cry until your eyes are swollen.

09:32.960 --> 09:34.600
If Father wakes up and sees that,

09:34.600 --> 09:35.650
he'll be upset.

09:38.600 --> 09:40.130
He wouldn't be upset at all.

09:41.120 --> 09:42.000
In his heart and eyes,

09:42.000 --> 09:43.330
there's no place for me,

09:43.910 --> 09:44.960
or for you.

09:47.150 --> 09:49.410
The only one he cares about is that woman.

09:49.720 --> 09:50.630
That woman?

09:51.670 --> 09:53.780
You mean Brother's birth mother?

09:53.950 --> 09:55.480
You see him as your brother,

09:56.270 --> 09:58.930
but has he ever acknowledged you
as his brother?

09:59.480 --> 10:00.150
Remember,

10:00.720 --> 10:01.670
Feng Suige

10:01.670 --> 10:03.440
is your greatest enemy in this lifetime.

10:03.440 --> 10:05.240
You'd better stay away from him.

10:05.960 --> 10:06.800
Do you know

10:09.030 --> 10:10.360
what will happen

10:10.360 --> 10:12.090
if your father doesn't wake up?

10:14.080 --> 10:16.010
Feng Suige will ascend the throne.

10:16.840 --> 10:18.080
By then, he'll kill you

10:18.080 --> 10:19.370
and me.

10:19.600 --> 10:20.890
If he succeeds,

10:21.630 --> 10:23.000
we'll both die.

10:23.910 --> 10:24.790
He's always hated me

10:24.790 --> 10:26.720
for causing his birth mother's death.

10:26.720 --> 10:27.510
That's why he refuses

10:27.510 --> 10:28.840
to acknowledge me as his mother,

10:28.840 --> 10:30.320
or you as his brother.

10:31.080 --> 10:32.810
He's been waiting for this day.

10:34.000 --> 10:36.130
He's waiting for your father to be gone

10:36.200 --> 10:37.660
so he can take his revenge.

10:38.080 --> 10:39.750
And your father, even though

10:39.750 --> 10:41.680
he knows exactly what will happen,

10:42.120 --> 10:44.180
still refuses to name a crown prince.

10:44.670 --> 10:46.480
I know he hates me deep down.

10:47.200 --> 10:47.840
Mother,

10:48.270 --> 10:49.150
please stop.

10:49.670 --> 10:51.270
Don't speak of them that way.

10:52.080 --> 10:54.010
Even you're taking their side now?

10:54.270 --> 10:56.130
Once your father passes away

10:56.840 --> 10:58.000
and Feng Suige takes the throne,

10:58.000 --> 10:59.130
he'll kill you

10:59.630 --> 11:01.030
and all of us.

11:03.280 --> 11:04.870
Our lives are in your hands.

11:05.630 --> 11:07.200
Only you can protect us.

11:11.600 --> 11:13.290
I want you to take the throne

11:13.460 --> 11:14.760
and kill Feng Suige.

11:15.910 --> 11:17.840
That's the only way we'll survive.

11:20.840 --> 11:23.930
[Imperial Hospital]

11:28.360 --> 11:29.440
From today on,

11:30.120 --> 11:31.840
no one is allowed to leave

11:32.000 --> 11:34.130
until we find a way to save His Majesty.

11:34.480 --> 11:36.280
Eating, drinking, and dumping—

11:36.510 --> 11:38.040
you'll do everything here.

11:41.150 --> 11:42.750
Even Lord Ling from Zhengnian Villa

11:42.750 --> 11:43.680
has no solution.

11:43.750 --> 11:46.240
We're at a complete loss as well.

11:47.630 --> 11:48.490
Physician Wei,

11:50.000 --> 11:52.360
that must be very difficult for you.

11:52.440 --> 11:53.320
No, not at all.

12:13.910 --> 12:15.350
Being at a loss

12:15.390 --> 12:17.850
just shows your medical skills
are lacking.

12:18.440 --> 12:19.700
It's better to die

12:19.870 --> 12:21.270
and, in your next life,

12:21.270 --> 12:22.670
study medicine properly from the start.

12:22.670 --> 12:23.510
Don't you all

12:24.510 --> 12:24.960
agree?

12:31.630 --> 12:32.490
What do you say?

12:36.750 --> 12:37.790
I'll take your silence

12:37.790 --> 12:38.590
as agreement.

12:38.720 --> 12:39.820
From now on,

12:39.870 --> 12:41.550
if you find any method in medical books

12:41.550 --> 12:42.630
that could wake His Majesty,

12:42.630 --> 12:43.990
try it on him.

12:44.550 --> 12:46.480
Don't worry about whether he might die.

12:46.480 --> 12:48.440
If he does, I'll get you

12:51.360 --> 12:52.090
another one.

13:00.240 --> 13:02.610
[Murong Residence]

13:16.120 --> 13:17.750
Elder Marquis eats well

13:18.000 --> 13:19.030
and sleeps soundly.

13:19.030 --> 13:19.810
Don't worry.

13:20.240 --> 13:21.300
No need to thank me.

13:21.670 --> 13:22.390
Yixiao.

13:24.670 --> 13:25.320
My Lord,

13:25.510 --> 13:26.480
we chased down 3 streets

13:26.480 --> 13:28.080
but couldn't find the archer.

13:28.080 --> 13:29.270
Pull back all the people

13:29.270 --> 13:31.200
watching Feng Suige's residence!

13:31.480 --> 13:32.620
But if we pull them back now...

13:32.620 --> 13:33.840
My father is in someone else's hands!

13:33.840 --> 13:35.770
What's the point of keeping watch?

13:36.000 --> 13:36.550
Go!

13:36.960 --> 13:37.360
Yes.

13:37.390 --> 13:37.870
Yes.

13:39.320 --> 13:40.510
Fu Yixiao,

13:41.440 --> 13:42.550
just you wait.

13:43.860 --> 13:49.610
[Wutong Mansion]

13:50.000 --> 13:50.600
Lu Ke.

13:56.670 --> 13:57.440
Miss Yixiao?

13:57.840 --> 13:59.000
Where have you been?

13:59.020 --> 13:59.870
His Highness has long known

13:59.870 --> 14:01.010
that you haven't left Yujing.

14:01.010 --> 14:02.370
I'll explain later.

14:02.400 --> 14:03.600
Where is your master?

14:03.800 --> 14:04.910
He entered the palace last night

14:04.910 --> 14:06.320
and hasn't returned today.

14:06.320 --> 14:07.910
Then please pass on a message for me.

14:07.910 --> 14:09.390
I want to see him at 3 p.m. today.

14:09.390 --> 14:10.600
Tell him to come alone.

14:10.600 --> 14:11.440
Is there anything else

14:11.440 --> 14:12.640
you want me to convey?

14:12.750 --> 14:13.680
Give this to him.

14:14.200 --> 14:15.860
He knows where we should meet.

14:16.550 --> 14:16.910
How does he...

14:16.910 --> 14:18.110
Make sure to tell him.

14:18.320 --> 14:19.240
I have something very important

14:19.240 --> 14:19.910
to tell him.

14:20.480 --> 14:21.210
Don't worry.

14:30.940 --> 14:32.740
I have one more thing to tell you.

14:32.750 --> 14:34.630
Appointing a crown prince
is a major matter.

14:34.630 --> 14:36.050
His Majesty is wise and mighty.

14:36.050 --> 14:38.370
He must have made arrangements already!

14:39.200 --> 14:40.240
Do you really think,

14:40.240 --> 14:41.260
while he's ill,

14:41.440 --> 14:42.670
that you alone

14:42.690 --> 14:44.550
can turn everything upside down?

14:44.670 --> 14:46.360
Give up that idea!

15:02.550 --> 15:04.220
Greetings, Prime Minister Zhuang.

15:04.220 --> 15:05.840
May I ask why

15:05.870 --> 15:06.980
you summoned me?

15:07.240 --> 15:08.300
You don't know why?

15:08.720 --> 15:10.260
It's just the two of us here.

15:10.480 --> 15:11.190
Mr. Ma,

15:11.510 --> 15:12.320
let's just

15:12.910 --> 15:14.320
speak plainly.

15:16.230 --> 15:18.010
You've been serving His Majesty
for so long.

15:18.010 --> 15:20.130
You must be his most trusted person.

15:21.440 --> 15:24.280
His Majesty always plans ahead.

15:24.670 --> 15:25.390
Since he knows

15:25.390 --> 15:26.630
he has a terminal illness,

15:26.630 --> 15:28.240
he must have made preparations.

15:28.240 --> 15:29.720
Has he already drafted

15:29.750 --> 15:31.080
an edict of succession?

15:39.550 --> 15:40.870
I am merely

15:40.870 --> 15:41.790
the head eunuch.

15:41.790 --> 15:43.360
Many things are beyond my knowledge.

15:43.360 --> 15:45.200
Please understand, Prime Minister Zhuang.

15:45.200 --> 15:46.840
You are his most trusted person.

15:46.840 --> 15:48.280
If there is an edict,

15:48.440 --> 15:50.440
it should be in your custody, right?

15:51.870 --> 15:53.630
I truly know nothing.

15:55.320 --> 15:56.650
I'm only asking.

15:57.750 --> 15:58.670
Since you don't know,

15:58.670 --> 15:59.870
I'll trust you.

16:01.550 --> 16:03.600
I will fulfill my duty as Prime Minister

16:03.600 --> 16:05.860
and summon all the key ministers at court

16:06.360 --> 16:09.360
to discuss the matter
of appointing the crown prince.

16:12.150 --> 16:12.960
Mr. Ma,

16:14.240 --> 16:16.240
don't wait until we reach a decision

16:16.750 --> 16:17.750
and then suddenly pull out

16:17.750 --> 16:19.030
some imperial edict—

16:19.320 --> 16:20.120
that would be

16:21.440 --> 16:23.150
impossible to deal with.

16:56.790 --> 16:57.390
Yao.

17:12.710 --> 17:14.510
I heard about what happened
to the Elder Marquis.

17:14.510 --> 17:15.910
How is the situation now?

17:16.109 --> 17:17.200
You've heard that?

17:17.640 --> 17:19.000
Someone actually dared to lay hands

17:19.000 --> 17:20.589
on the Elder Marquis in Yujing City.

17:20.589 --> 17:21.990
They're courting death.

17:22.640 --> 17:23.270
I'll order all the elite soldiers

17:23.270 --> 17:24.599
from the Feng Battalion

17:24.640 --> 17:25.720
to search the entire city.

17:25.720 --> 17:27.160
We'll leave no stone unturned

17:27.160 --> 17:27.640
to find...

17:27.640 --> 17:29.770
No need to trouble the Feng Battalion.

17:30.200 --> 17:31.730
I have the Imperial Guards.

17:32.690 --> 17:33.370
Yao,

17:33.960 --> 17:36.160
The Elder Marquis is like a father to me.

17:36.350 --> 17:37.880
Anyone who dares to kidnap him

17:37.880 --> 17:39.310
is making an enemy of me.

17:40.200 --> 17:41.030
Tell me

17:41.270 --> 17:42.200
what happened

17:42.200 --> 17:43.680
before the Elder Marquis disappeared.

17:43.680 --> 17:46.140
I want to figure out
who might be behind this.

17:48.070 --> 17:49.480
My father spent most of his life
on the battlefield.

17:49.480 --> 17:50.880
He made too many enemies.

17:51.270 --> 17:53.200
Countless people want to harm him.

17:53.550 --> 17:54.150
Forget it.

17:54.720 --> 17:55.460
Don't worry

17:55.590 --> 17:56.350
about it.

17:56.830 --> 17:57.810
I came to see you

17:58.350 --> 17:59.880
because the duty of guarding the palace

17:59.880 --> 18:01.880
has to be temporarily handed over to you.

18:01.880 --> 18:04.160
You must keep watch over
the palace for me.

18:04.160 --> 18:04.720
Alright.

18:16.270 --> 18:16.830
What?

18:17.400 --> 18:18.590
You don't trust me?

18:24.640 --> 18:25.840
Of course I trust you.

18:26.550 --> 18:27.920
You're my best friend.

18:29.480 --> 18:31.030
You seem a bit off today.

18:42.000 --> 18:43.510
What I'm going to do now

18:44.270 --> 18:45.720
is catch the person

18:45.750 --> 18:46.830
who harmed my father,

18:46.830 --> 18:48.400
flay him, pull out his entrails,

18:48.400 --> 18:49.530
grind him into mince

18:49.750 --> 18:51.010
and feed it to the dogs.

18:59.310 --> 19:00.880
I'm not like my father.

19:02.000 --> 19:03.960
I'll collect any debts

19:04.750 --> 19:06.210
owed to the Murong family.

19:07.550 --> 19:09.310
Even if it's my closest friend,

19:10.440 --> 19:12.270
I'll settle the score.

19:16.880 --> 19:18.030
A dancing girl

19:18.350 --> 19:20.210
got beaten to death for no reason.

19:20.550 --> 19:21.000
I know

19:21.000 --> 19:22.550
you wanted to teach the Prince of Zhennan
a lesson,

19:22.550 --> 19:24.110
but you shouldn't have killed her
so recklessly.

19:24.110 --> 19:25.040
If this gets out,

19:25.070 --> 19:26.000
how will it look?

19:27.350 --> 19:28.060
Also,

19:28.350 --> 19:29.620
when I came in just now,

19:29.960 --> 19:31.350
I saw another official's wife

19:31.350 --> 19:32.400
leaving your place.

19:32.400 --> 19:33.090
Tell me,

19:33.310 --> 19:34.780
what's with her clothes?

19:36.110 --> 19:37.590
Mother,
you think it looks good too, right?

19:37.590 --> 19:38.310
I picked it for her.

19:38.310 --> 19:38.920
Absurd!

19:39.510 --> 19:41.840
That's the Princess of Zhennan's outfit.

19:45.240 --> 19:47.440
Don't tell me you have feelings for her.

19:51.270 --> 19:52.790
I didn't think it that way.

19:53.510 --> 19:55.030
But now that you mentioned it…

19:55.030 --> 19:56.510
Don't you dare set your sights on her!

19:56.510 --> 19:57.550
There are plenty of consorts
in the palace,

19:57.550 --> 19:58.680
but you never touch them.

19:58.680 --> 20:00.160
Yet you always scheme after

20:00.160 --> 20:01.220
officials' wives.

20:01.270 --> 20:02.070
I'm tired of lecturing you

20:02.070 --> 20:03.350
about your rotten behavior.

20:03.350 --> 20:04.190
But remember,

20:04.310 --> 20:06.270
you are not
to touch the Princess of Zhennan.

20:06.270 --> 20:07.000
Mother,

20:07.480 --> 20:08.310
you don't actually treat him

20:08.310 --> 20:09.570
as your own son, do you?

20:11.110 --> 20:12.680
If I had a son like him,

20:12.960 --> 20:14.130
would I still be getting angry every day

20:14.130 --> 20:14.880
like this?

20:19.560 --> 20:20.590
You sent him back to the capital

20:20.590 --> 20:21.920
without consulting me.

20:21.960 --> 20:22.590
This is clearly

20:22.590 --> 20:23.720
asking for trouble.

20:25.110 --> 20:27.170
You humiliated him again last night?

20:29.670 --> 20:31.070
He can't stay in the capital anymore.

20:31.070 --> 20:32.600
Send him away immediately.

20:32.960 --> 20:33.920
Send him away?

20:33.990 --> 20:35.350
That's like releasing a tiger
back to the mountain.

20:35.350 --> 20:36.240
Once he reaches Shengjing,

20:36.240 --> 20:38.040
Pingling City will get the news.

20:38.510 --> 20:39.920
Mother, are you really that afraid of him?

20:39.920 --> 20:41.920
What I'm afraid of is political instability
in Jinxiu

20:41.920 --> 20:43.240
and internal strife.

20:44.640 --> 20:45.940
As you said,

20:46.070 --> 20:47.000
his greatest support

20:47.000 --> 20:48.600
is the army in Pingling City.

20:49.070 --> 20:50.350
Now that he's in Shengjing,

20:50.350 --> 20:51.310
he's in danger.

20:51.550 --> 20:52.230
Mother,

20:52.400 --> 20:53.000
how do you think he can communicate

20:53.000 --> 20:54.530
with them in Pingling City?

20:57.200 --> 20:58.720
If he's obedient, it'll be fine.

20:58.720 --> 20:59.590
But if he's not,

21:00.350 --> 21:02.750
he'll definitely make moves in Shengjing.

21:02.790 --> 21:04.160
I want him to reveal

21:04.200 --> 21:05.070
all his cards

21:05.590 --> 21:06.750
in Shengjing.

21:08.160 --> 21:09.020
Just one thing—

21:09.550 --> 21:12.480
you must not set your sights
on the Princess of Susha.

21:20.790 --> 21:21.590
Bai Shouzhuo!

21:24.880 --> 21:25.680
Your Majesty.

21:26.750 --> 21:27.790
The Empress Dowager forbids me

21:27.790 --> 21:29.200
from setting my sights
on the Princess of Susha.

21:29.200 --> 21:30.930
I had no such intention anyway.

21:31.720 --> 21:32.200
But now,

21:32.200 --> 21:33.610
somehow,

21:34.320 --> 21:35.920
I find this very intriguing.

21:59.880 --> 22:00.680
Grandfather.

22:01.510 --> 22:02.970
I heard your mother is ill.

22:03.830 --> 22:04.960
Mother is sleeping.

22:05.790 --> 22:07.650
Last night she went to see Father,

22:07.880 --> 22:08.830
stayed up all night,

22:08.830 --> 22:09.960
and ran a high fever.

22:10.590 --> 22:11.400
The imperial physicians have already come

22:11.400 --> 22:13.000
to check on her this morning.

22:18.000 --> 22:18.830
How are you?

22:19.400 --> 22:20.610
I spent the whole night
copying the Heart Sutra

22:20.610 --> 22:21.930
for Father and Mother,

22:22.880 --> 22:24.540
hoping they'll recover soon.

22:25.480 --> 22:26.610
Let me ask you again—

22:26.680 --> 22:27.720
how are you?

22:29.160 --> 22:30.040
I...

22:30.510 --> 22:31.680
You're 20 now,

22:31.720 --> 22:32.720
a grown man.

22:33.070 --> 22:34.160
Are you ready?

22:35.310 --> 22:37.240
Father was perfectly fine before.

22:38.720 --> 22:39.830
I don't know why

22:39.880 --> 22:41.270
he suddenly became like this.

22:41.270 --> 22:42.730
I truly don't understand.

22:43.270 --> 22:44.880
If Father truly doesn't make it,

22:44.880 --> 22:45.350
then...

22:45.590 --> 22:47.120
That's not what I'm asking.

22:47.550 --> 22:48.070
I'm asking

22:48.070 --> 22:49.160
if you're ready

22:49.200 --> 22:51.000
to become the ruler of the realm.

23:00.590 --> 23:02.520
Once your father passes away

23:02.680 --> 23:04.480
and Feng Suige takes the throne,

23:04.680 --> 23:05.920
he'll kill you

23:05.920 --> 23:07.160
and all of us.

23:07.830 --> 23:09.480
Our lives are in your hands.

23:09.680 --> 23:11.240
Only you can protect us.

23:14.310 --> 23:15.240
I've...

23:16.150 --> 23:17.610
never thought about that.

23:18.000 --> 23:20.200
Don't you even trust your grandfather?

23:20.550 --> 23:21.200
I do.

23:23.240 --> 23:23.960
I...

23:24.860 --> 23:26.280
respect you the most.

23:29.270 --> 23:30.510
Then why aren't you looking at me

23:30.510 --> 23:31.720
when you speak?

23:33.640 --> 23:34.310
Remember,

23:35.350 --> 23:37.270
I always stand by your side.

23:37.590 --> 23:38.450
You, your mother,

23:38.450 --> 23:39.600
and I—

23:40.310 --> 23:41.410
our fates

23:41.830 --> 23:43.500
rise and fall together.

23:50.600 --> 23:51.580
I'll do

23:52.880 --> 23:54.160
whatever you say.

23:57.270 --> 23:58.050
I want you

23:58.570 --> 23:59.950
to become Emperor.

24:09.270 --> 24:10.200
Yes.

24:10.720 --> 24:12.890
To be Emperor, you must act like one.

24:13.270 --> 24:14.070
Louder!

24:23.180 --> 24:25.290
I want to be Emperor.

24:36.240 --> 24:37.100
Your Highness,

24:37.360 --> 24:39.290
Miss Yixiao asked me to give this to you.

24:39.290 --> 24:40.490
What else did she say?

24:40.720 --> 24:41.690
Nothing.

24:41.750 --> 24:42.700
She said that once you see it,

24:42.700 --> 24:43.830
you'll understand.

24:46.110 --> 24:47.440
She was so cautious

24:47.440 --> 24:48.510
about asking me to meet.

24:48.510 --> 24:50.180
There must be a reason.

24:51.720 --> 24:53.150
Did she look well?

24:53.200 --> 24:54.110
She seemed fine.

24:54.110 --> 24:55.350
No illness, no injuries,

24:55.350 --> 24:56.390
nothing unusual—

24:56.480 --> 24:57.870
just a bit mysterious.

24:58.000 --> 24:58.600
Oh, right.

24:58.640 --> 24:59.720
She repeatedly reminded me

24:59.720 --> 25:00.350
to tell you that

25:00.350 --> 25:01.750
you must go see her alone.

25:20.480 --> 25:21.590
It's not safe to talk here.

25:21.590 --> 25:22.300
Follow me.

25:37.050 --> 25:40.200
♪ Lost in the wilderness ♪

25:40.570 --> 25:43.050
♪ I've been looking for you ♪

25:43.520 --> 25:46.410
♪ Even if devastation fills my eyes ♪

25:47.040 --> 25:49.450
♪ The shadows continue to sway ♪

25:47.830 --> 25:48.510
Don't move.

25:49.880 --> 25:52.790
♪ The phoenix going against light ♪

25:51.030 --> 25:52.490
Let me give you a hug first.

25:53.250 --> 25:56.170
♪ Has been looking for a thousand miles ♪

25:56.990 --> 25:59.870
♪ As years pass, dust stirs,
stirring deep longing ♪

26:00.520 --> 26:06.000
♪ All I ask is to be together  forever ♪

26:07.480 --> 26:08.290
I know

26:09.510 --> 26:10.660
that the reason you cautiously

26:10.660 --> 26:11.460
asked to see me

26:12.110 --> 26:13.970
must be that something happened.

26:19.440 --> 26:21.040
I've already caught Wu Ying.

26:21.750 --> 26:23.000
I'll make her

26:23.350 --> 26:23.960
feel the pain

26:23.960 --> 26:25.920
you once suffered a thousandfold.

26:31.920 --> 26:32.750
Aren't you happy

26:32.750 --> 26:33.640
to hear that?

26:35.720 --> 26:36.350
I am.

26:38.030 --> 26:38.680
Really?

26:39.790 --> 26:40.960
On your face,

26:41.440 --> 26:42.160
I can't see

26:42.160 --> 26:43.420
any sign of happiness.

26:53.240 --> 26:54.640
Do you remember that day,

26:54.750 --> 26:56.480
when I helped you save Yun Qing,

26:57.240 --> 26:58.790
you promised me 5 favors?

26:59.310 --> 27:00.440
Now there are 4 left.

27:02.030 --> 27:02.680
Today,

27:03.110 --> 27:04.510
I want to use another one.

27:05.030 --> 27:05.720
No matter

27:05.720 --> 27:06.750
what you hear,

27:07.440 --> 27:08.500
you must promise me

27:09.030 --> 27:10.110
to stay calm.

27:12.160 --> 27:12.720
Alright.

27:15.880 --> 27:18.480
I've discovered Meng Junran's
true identity.

27:20.030 --> 27:21.210
He is Murong Yao.

27:36.680 --> 27:37.820
What are you saying?

27:38.480 --> 27:40.010
How could he possibly be...

27:46.920 --> 27:48.700
You're not joking?

27:53.900 --> 27:55.760
I know it's hard for you to accept.

27:56.070 --> 27:57.470
Before coming to see you,

27:57.640 --> 27:59.110
I considered all possibilities.

27:59.110 --> 27:59.810
I know

27:59.960 --> 28:01.620
Murong Yao is your best friend

28:01.880 --> 28:03.370
and the person you trust most.

28:03.370 --> 28:05.280
I considered
whether I should hide this from you.

28:05.280 --> 28:06.200
I also thought about

28:06.200 --> 28:07.460
who you'd choose to believe

28:07.460 --> 28:08.480
between him and me.

28:08.480 --> 28:09.580
I even thought

28:09.680 --> 28:10.480
you might suspect

28:10.480 --> 28:11.720
that I'm a spy from Jinxiu,

28:11.720 --> 28:12.790
or that I've been sent

28:12.790 --> 28:13.960
by Xia Jingshi

28:14.000 --> 28:14.960
on some secret mission—

28:14.960 --> 28:15.720
that I

28:15.720 --> 28:16.720
came to you

28:17.110 --> 28:18.310
only to help him drive a wedge

28:18.310 --> 28:20.170
between you and your best friend.

28:26.830 --> 28:27.640
Feng Suige,

28:28.310 --> 28:30.040
I've thought through all of it.

28:31.030 --> 28:32.450
Even if you doubt me,

28:33.240 --> 28:34.640
even if my words hurt you,

28:35.510 --> 28:36.270
even if

28:37.420 --> 28:38.760
it means losing you,

28:40.920 --> 28:42.650
I've still decided to tell you.

28:43.110 --> 28:43.750
I don't want to

28:43.750 --> 28:45.030
keep anything from you.

28:45.030 --> 28:47.030
You have the right to know the truth.

28:54.160 --> 28:56.070
Can you tell me again—

28:58.200 --> 28:59.770
who is Meng Junran?

29:02.920 --> 29:04.510
You said it's Yao?

29:08.000 --> 29:09.000
Murong Yao?

29:15.350 --> 29:17.280
I know this must be painful for you.

29:17.830 --> 29:19.030
If your chest feels tight

29:19.030 --> 29:20.350
and it's hard to breathe,

29:20.350 --> 29:21.880
just take a few deep breaths

29:22.600 --> 29:23.570
and let it out.

29:24.420 --> 29:25.180
It's okay.

29:26.160 --> 29:27.560
Everything will be fine.

29:28.310 --> 29:29.570
It will all get better.

29:47.160 --> 29:47.920
I'm fine.

29:50.470 --> 29:52.330
I'll go ask him face to face.

29:53.310 --> 29:54.480
You promised me.

29:55.480 --> 29:56.540
You must stay calm.

30:02.680 --> 30:03.410
Don't worry.

30:28.750 --> 30:30.280
I invited you all here today

30:30.830 --> 30:32.070
to discuss

30:32.240 --> 30:33.840
several important matters.

30:33.920 --> 30:36.590
Minister Hou of the Ministry of War
was attacked and injured;

30:36.590 --> 30:38.240
he has requested leave to recover
in his hometown.

30:38.240 --> 30:39.550
The position of Minister

30:39.550 --> 30:41.030
cannot remain vacant.

30:41.880 --> 30:45.590
Let's have Vice Minister Liu Qin
of the Ministry of War

30:46.070 --> 30:48.870
temporarily take over the duties
of the minister.

30:50.160 --> 30:52.340
I will serve with utmost dedication

30:52.550 --> 30:53.810
until my dying breath.

30:54.400 --> 30:55.070
Second,

30:55.960 --> 30:58.290
His Majesty's condition is now critical,

30:58.480 --> 31:01.030
and the position of Crown Prince
remains vacant.

31:01.030 --> 31:01.640
As

31:02.270 --> 31:03.470
both a court official

31:03.590 --> 31:05.000
and a member of the royal family,

31:05.000 --> 31:05.590
I

31:05.830 --> 31:07.830
shouldn't speak pessimistically,

31:07.830 --> 31:09.650
but for the sake of the realm,

31:10.350 --> 31:11.570
we can no longer delay

31:11.880 --> 31:13.340
the matter of succession.

31:14.590 --> 31:15.560
In my opinion,

31:15.750 --> 31:18.440
the Second Prince,
being the Empress's legitimate son

31:18.440 --> 31:19.590
of noble birth

31:19.610 --> 31:20.790
and virtuous character,

31:20.790 --> 31:22.030
is the most suitable choice

31:22.030 --> 31:23.510
for Crown Prince.

31:25.790 --> 31:26.960
But after all, the First Prince

31:26.960 --> 31:28.310
is the eldest legitimate son.

31:28.310 --> 31:29.440
Throughout history,
the tradition has always been

31:29.440 --> 31:30.920
to appoint the eldest legitimate son
as Crown Prince.

31:30.920 --> 31:33.880
Shouldn't the First Prince
be appointed the Crown Prince?

31:33.880 --> 31:35.680
His Majesty is the founding emperor—

31:35.680 --> 31:36.480
there's no fixed rule

31:36.480 --> 31:38.100
for succession in Susha.

31:38.310 --> 31:40.880
Although the First Prince
is the eldest legitimate son,

31:40.880 --> 31:42.590
he has repeatedly defied His Majesty

31:42.590 --> 31:43.640
and acted without restraint.

31:43.640 --> 31:44.900
With such conduct,

31:45.110 --> 31:46.640
how can we entrust Susha's future

31:46.640 --> 31:47.240
to him?

31:47.830 --> 31:48.940
I agree.

31:49.070 --> 31:50.680
Before, during the Ancestral Ceremony,

31:50.680 --> 31:51.720
His Majesty personally appointed

31:51.720 --> 31:53.310
the Second Prince
as the secondary officiant.

31:53.310 --> 31:55.400
Clearly, in His Majesty's eyes,

31:55.590 --> 31:57.880
the Second Prince possesses
both virtue and talent.

31:57.880 --> 31:59.540
Thus, he is the best candidate

31:59.790 --> 32:02.300
for Crown Prince.

32:02.640 --> 32:03.790
I agree.

32:08.270 --> 32:09.480
I understand

32:10.320 --> 32:11.720
what you are suggesting.

32:12.270 --> 32:13.470
Please rest assured.

32:14.960 --> 32:17.510
Appointing an heir
concerns the nation's fate,

32:17.510 --> 32:18.200
and I

32:18.640 --> 32:20.640
will handle it with the utmost care.

32:21.920 --> 32:24.640
Prime Minister Zhuang,
the wise carry heavier burdens.

32:24.640 --> 32:26.170
Thank you for your efforts.

32:30.000 --> 32:32.460
Thank you for your efforts,
Prime Minister.

32:46.070 --> 32:47.240
I heard from others

32:47.240 --> 32:48.440
that you were badly wounded
in the Battle of Pingling.

32:48.440 --> 32:49.110
I came here to

32:49.110 --> 32:50.310
end our brotherhood.

32:50.400 --> 32:51.680
I no longer consider you my brother.

32:51.680 --> 32:53.150
You've been saying that

32:53.170 --> 32:54.500
since we were children.

32:54.510 --> 32:55.440
Don't tell me

32:55.780 --> 32:56.830
you'll miss me.

32:57.200 --> 32:58.110
Get lost!

32:58.440 --> 32:59.240
With you in Yujing City,

32:59.240 --> 33:00.720
I'm annoyed nonstop all day.

33:00.720 --> 33:01.790
Annoyed?

33:02.000 --> 33:04.160
Aren't you happy with me here?
Why are you annoyed?

33:04.160 --> 33:05.000
But then again...

33:05.000 --> 33:06.640
If I were the Commander
of the Imperial Guards,

33:06.640 --> 33:08.570
I could certainly be of help to you.

33:09.030 --> 33:10.730
Don't you do that for me.

33:10.920 --> 33:11.880
I know you.

33:12.640 --> 33:14.160
You hate being tied down the most.

33:14.160 --> 33:14.940
But you have no influence

33:14.940 --> 33:16.050
in the court.

33:16.270 --> 33:18.110
Now that His Majesty has even had
the Second Prince

33:18.110 --> 33:20.030
take your place at the Ancestral Ceremony,

33:20.030 --> 33:21.310
how could I leave you behind

33:21.310 --> 33:22.710
and enjoy freedom alone?

33:44.150 --> 33:46.010
[Murong Residence]

33:47.540 --> 33:52.190
[Murong Residence]

34:35.210 --> 34:36.670
I've been waiting for you.

34:36.840 --> 34:37.580
I knew it.

34:37.870 --> 34:39.600
Fu Yixiao told you everything.

34:40.000 --> 34:41.360
Looks like she really does

34:41.360 --> 34:42.650
mean more to you than I do.

34:42.650 --> 34:44.440
We've been brothers for so many years.

34:44.440 --> 34:46.300
You believe everything she says?

34:46.590 --> 34:47.420
I came here

34:48.920 --> 34:50.900
to hear it from you directly—

34:52.230 --> 34:54.110
are you Meng Junran?

34:56.550 --> 34:57.360
Yes.

35:02.280 --> 35:04.490
Did Zhuang Shen force you?

35:04.590 --> 35:06.520
What leverage does he have on you?

35:06.580 --> 35:07.650
If you weren't being coerced,

35:07.650 --> 35:08.090
if you had no weakness,

35:08.090 --> 35:09.220
you'd never do this.

35:10.070 --> 35:10.920
Yao,

35:12.000 --> 35:13.150
we've been brothers for so many years.

35:13.150 --> 35:14.580
What can't you tell me?

35:14.670 --> 35:15.990
Are you in trouble?

35:16.070 --> 35:16.730
Tell me.

35:16.800 --> 35:17.860
I did it willingly!

35:18.130 --> 35:19.340
No one forced me!

35:23.190 --> 35:24.380
Why?

35:24.960 --> 35:26.760
I can't stand seeing you do so well.

35:26.760 --> 35:28.020
I'm jealous of you.

35:28.230 --> 35:30.090
You still won't tell me the truth?

35:30.360 --> 35:31.000
See?

35:32.270 --> 35:33.870
You don't believe me anyway.

35:34.880 --> 35:35.510
Fine.

35:36.470 --> 35:37.650
Then tell me—

35:38.280 --> 35:39.670
what have I

35:39.670 --> 35:40.930
ever done to wrong you?

35:41.110 --> 35:42.150
Why must it be that

35:42.150 --> 35:43.320
only if you wronged me

35:43.320 --> 35:44.870
could I stand against you?

35:45.190 --> 35:46.920
Am I not worthy to be your rival?

35:47.760 --> 35:48.800
If I want to go against you,

35:48.800 --> 35:50.110
it doesn't have to be
for some hidden reason.

35:50.110 --> 35:51.770
It can simply be my own choice.

35:52.670 --> 35:54.510
Your own choice?

35:56.150 --> 35:57.530
All my life,

35:58.230 --> 36:00.260
I've seen you as my closest brother.

36:01.150 --> 36:02.590
And now you're telling me

36:02.610 --> 36:03.550
you're going against me

36:03.550 --> 36:05.070
of your own choice?

36:05.510 --> 36:06.960
So you colluded with Xia Jingshi

36:06.960 --> 36:07.990
and Zhuang Shen

36:08.710 --> 36:10.190
to take my life?

36:11.190 --> 36:12.850
I could have spared your life.

36:13.670 --> 36:14.320
I could have done everything

36:14.320 --> 36:15.360
I wanted

36:15.360 --> 36:16.820
without you ever knowing.

36:17.070 --> 36:18.590
But you got in my way.

36:19.590 --> 36:20.560
I have no choice.

36:20.840 --> 36:22.500
There's nothing else I can do.

36:23.480 --> 36:24.880
What are you trying to do?

36:27.320 --> 36:28.280
Tell me!

36:29.480 --> 36:30.380
Murong Yao,

36:30.920 --> 36:32.630
what do you want?

36:42.880 --> 36:43.740
When we were 10,

36:44.190 --> 36:46.190
we went with our fathers
to inspect the border.

36:46.190 --> 36:46.960
Do you remember

36:46.960 --> 36:48.150
that time we sneaked off

36:48.150 --> 36:49.110
without permission to play

36:49.110 --> 36:50.440
and ran into assassins?

37:02.960 --> 37:04.220
Don't come any closer!

37:04.590 --> 37:05.670
What are you doing?

37:09.590 --> 37:10.480
Stay back!

37:13.590 --> 37:15.590
If my father hadn't arrived in time,

37:15.630 --> 37:17.090
we would have been doomed.

37:18.030 --> 37:19.760
But there were too many assassins.

37:19.760 --> 37:21.760
My father couldn't handle them all.

37:22.150 --> 37:23.350
I only realized later

37:24.000 --> 37:24.840
that my father at that moment

37:24.840 --> 37:25.550
never thought

37:25.550 --> 37:26.710
he would survive.

37:27.150 --> 37:28.030
The only person

37:28.110 --> 37:29.110
he cared about

37:30.550 --> 37:31.400
was you,

37:32.470 --> 37:33.840
the First Prince.

37:38.150 --> 37:42.190
Kill!

37:42.820 --> 37:44.480
In that life-and-death moment,

37:44.480 --> 37:45.710
the first person he tried to save

37:45.710 --> 37:47.310
was you, not me.

37:47.400 --> 37:47.860
Father!

37:47.880 --> 37:49.560
I was his own son!

37:49.840 --> 37:50.320
Go!

37:50.610 --> 37:52.440
At the time, I couldn't understand

37:52.440 --> 37:53.190
why your life

37:53.190 --> 37:54.790
was more precious than mine.

37:55.070 --> 37:56.350
Later, I realized

37:56.960 --> 37:57.710
it was because you were the First Prince.

37:57.710 --> 37:59.480
If anything had happened to you,

37:59.480 --> 38:02.340
the entire Murong family
would have been executed.

38:03.190 --> 38:04.440
That's why my father

38:04.440 --> 38:06.170
risked everything to save you.

38:11.840 --> 38:13.030
Father!

38:13.960 --> 38:15.280
Father!

38:23.800 --> 38:24.960
Yao!

38:26.000 --> 38:27.230
Yao!

38:32.150 --> 38:33.450
Yao!

38:34.070 --> 38:35.150
That was the first time

38:35.150 --> 38:36.550
I ever truly faced death.

38:37.360 --> 38:38.550
I remember countless blades

38:38.550 --> 38:40.410
slashing toward my father and me.

38:41.070 --> 38:42.660
My mind went blank,

38:42.710 --> 38:44.050
and all I could do was cry

38:44.190 --> 38:46.020
and beg for someone to save me.

38:55.360 --> 38:56.980
It hurt so much.

38:57.190 --> 38:58.590
The pain was unbearable.

38:59.220 --> 39:00.760
I passed out from the pain.

39:01.230 --> 39:02.360
When I woke up,

39:02.670 --> 39:03.960
they were all dead.

39:04.920 --> 39:06.300
My father was severely wounded,

39:06.300 --> 39:07.440
all from blades.

39:07.840 --> 39:09.150
It was then that his leg was injured

39:09.150 --> 39:10.320
and left with a chronic ailment.

39:10.320 --> 39:12.850
Even now,
it still pains him from time to time.

39:14.400 --> 39:15.670
Father!

39:15.800 --> 39:17.010
Son.

39:17.630 --> 39:18.480
Father!

39:18.500 --> 39:19.590
With me here,

39:20.030 --> 39:22.230
you don't need to be afraid of anything.

39:23.710 --> 39:25.480
Suige!

39:25.960 --> 39:30.360
Suige, please come save us!

39:31.590 --> 39:32.720
What happened next?

39:33.590 --> 39:35.400
How did you get out of danger?

39:36.880 --> 39:37.800
I kept waiting,

39:38.760 --> 39:40.760
waiting for His Majesty to send people
to rescue us.

39:40.760 --> 39:41.590
But I waited for a long time,

39:41.590 --> 39:43.030
and no one ever came.

39:43.840 --> 39:45.280
Later I realized,

39:46.400 --> 39:48.630
as long as you,
the First Prince, was safe,

39:48.630 --> 39:50.960
no one would care
whether we lived or died.

39:51.510 --> 39:54.000
The First Prince was ambushed,
and His Majesty flew into a rage.

39:54.000 --> 39:54.840
At that time,

39:55.880 --> 39:57.030
who would have remembered

39:57.030 --> 39:58.000
my father and me?

40:02.590 --> 40:03.360
That road

40:03.880 --> 40:06.140
was only a few miles from the border camp,

40:06.150 --> 40:08.150
yet it was the longest, hardest road

40:08.590 --> 40:10.120
I've ever walked in my life.

40:21.190 --> 40:22.510
Here's His Majesty's verbal decree!

40:22.510 --> 40:24.370
Murong Zhong, heed this command.

40:24.550 --> 40:25.500
From this day on,

40:25.550 --> 40:26.710
the Murong clan

40:26.710 --> 40:28.550
is to guard the northern border of Susha.

40:28.550 --> 40:29.880
You are forbidden to return to the capital

40:29.880 --> 40:31.210
without royal summons.

40:32.460 --> 40:33.140
I

40:33.590 --> 40:35.240
will depart tomorrow.

40:35.360 --> 40:36.820
Better if you leave today.

40:37.150 --> 40:38.430
His Majesty also said

40:38.630 --> 40:39.920
that the Murong family
bears unshirkable responsibility

40:39.920 --> 40:41.000
for what happened

40:41.000 --> 40:42.940
to the First Prince.

40:43.840 --> 40:44.690
But

40:45.150 --> 40:47.510
in recognition of your service
in protecting him,

40:47.510 --> 40:49.190
you will not be punished.

40:49.280 --> 40:51.630
Thank you, Your Majesty.

40:54.000 --> 40:54.930
Yao,

40:55.360 --> 40:56.840
my father and I

40:56.840 --> 40:57.880
gave you the chance to live,

40:57.880 --> 40:58.710
yet in the end, we were sent to suffer

40:58.710 --> 40:59.590
in the northern frontier.

40:59.590 --> 41:00.670
Why is your life

41:00.690 --> 41:02.030
worth more than ours?

41:02.230 --> 41:03.590
Why must the Murong family

41:03.590 --> 41:04.230
always be ready

41:04.230 --> 41:06.090
to sacrifice for the Feng family?

41:06.590 --> 41:08.520
Why didn't you send people to get us

41:08.590 --> 41:09.800
after you returned?

41:10.230 --> 41:11.630
Why didn't you send people to save us?

41:11.630 --> 41:12.960
Why didn't you
plead with His Majesty for us?

41:12.960 --> 41:14.320
Aren't we brothers?

41:16.400 --> 41:18.200
Where were you when I needed you?

41:19.070 --> 41:20.150
Where were you?

41:20.320 --> 41:21.360
After I woke up,

41:22.110 --> 41:23.320
the first thing I did was ask

41:23.320 --> 41:24.920
how you and your father were.

41:25.630 --> 41:26.980
But they told me at the time

41:26.980 --> 41:28.980
that you were already out of danger.

41:29.400 --> 41:30.280
When I saw you again,

41:30.280 --> 41:31.630
it was two years later.

41:32.030 --> 41:33.430
So at that time I thought

41:33.510 --> 41:34.030
you...

41:35.070 --> 41:36.070
You thought?

41:36.480 --> 41:37.190
You Fengs

41:37.190 --> 41:38.670
always only care about what you think.

41:38.670 --> 41:41.000
Have you ever considered how others feel?

41:41.190 --> 41:41.880
Yao,

41:43.480 --> 41:44.360
why didn't you

41:44.360 --> 41:46.120
tell me all this sooner?

41:46.230 --> 41:47.630
If I had told you earlier,

41:48.360 --> 41:50.000
could you have given me back
part of my foot?

41:50.000 --> 41:50.630
Could you have made my father's legs

41:50.630 --> 41:52.490
stop hurting so much every night?

41:52.840 --> 41:54.500
Even if I had told you earlier,

41:54.790 --> 41:56.030
what could I have gained—

41:56.030 --> 41:57.100
besides your pity?

41:57.510 --> 41:58.220
Feng Suige,

41:58.360 --> 41:59.220
let me tell you—

41:59.630 --> 42:01.110
the thing I despise most

42:01.110 --> 42:02.000
in this life

42:02.760 --> 42:04.360
is your pity.

42:06.000 --> 42:07.930
I also come from a military family!

42:07.960 --> 42:09.070
I want to be a great general

42:09.070 --> 42:10.520
like you.

42:11.510 --> 42:13.110
But I can't even ride a horse.

42:13.840 --> 42:14.920
Back then, my father and yours

42:14.920 --> 42:16.440
fought side by side
to build Susha together.

42:16.440 --> 42:17.360
Your father became emperor,

42:17.360 --> 42:18.190
while mine is just a marquis

42:18.190 --> 42:19.760
in name only.

42:20.800 --> 42:21.550
Is that fair?

42:23.510 --> 42:24.480
Yao,

42:25.920 --> 42:27.050
stop this.

42:28.280 --> 42:29.900
While you still can.

42:31.400 --> 42:33.190
I've been thinking about this
for over a decade.

42:33.190 --> 42:34.270
How do you expect me to stop?

42:34.270 --> 42:35.100
How can I?

42:36.590 --> 42:38.320
For once, I want to live for myself.

42:38.320 --> 42:39.920
I only want the Murong family

42:40.000 --> 42:41.590
to get what it rightfully deserves.

42:41.590 --> 42:42.500
Is that wrong?

42:44.760 --> 42:46.840
While my father is in Fu Yixiao's hands,

42:46.840 --> 42:48.300
I can't do anything to you.

42:48.480 --> 42:49.660
You can kill me.

42:52.760 --> 42:53.600
What?

42:54.150 --> 42:55.810
Can't bring yourself to do it?

43:18.150 --> 43:18.950
How about now?

43:19.110 --> 43:21.040
Can you bring yourself to do it now?

43:21.550 --> 43:23.010
I have only one condition:

43:23.110 --> 43:24.170
release my father.

43:24.440 --> 43:26.040
He knows nothing about this.

43:36.710 --> 43:38.360
From today on,

43:40.110 --> 43:41.480
we're even.

43:43.840 --> 43:45.480
We're no longer brothers.
